   4:Source/render/layout.c ****  *
   5:Source/render/layout.c ****  * Every observable behavior of the reference is reproduced, including:
   6:Source/render/layout.c ****  *   - breakLines word/whitespace scanning (Lua %s = the five ASCII space
   7:Source/render/layout.c ****  *     chars), leading-space drop, gap collapse, tab-run advance measured
   8:Source/render/layout.c ****  *     from cur.width+ww, first-word overflow staying on the line.
   9:Source/render/layout.c ****  *   - emitFlow center/right x, link-rect merge across same href+anchor,
  10:Source/render/layout.c ****  *     sub/sup dy, per-word item flags, mrText "a b" joining.
  11:Source/render/layout.c ****  *   - Layout.build geometry for all 16 block types incl. form link rects
  12:Source/render/layout.c ****  *     ("#"/"input:"/"select:"/"toggle:"), image-map scaling, box_stack y2
  13:Source/render/layout.c ****  *     patching, totalHeight clamp max(currentY+20, CONTENT_HEIGHT).
  14:Source/render/layout.c ****  *   - Layout.draw culling rules per item type (exact y comparisons),
  15:Source/render/layout.c ****  *     selection inversion, code/table/checkbox/select/meter/box rendering,
  16:Source/render/layout.c ****  *     image modes, scrollbar (barH max(16, CH*CH/total)), overlay panel.
  17:Source/render/layout.c ****  *
  18:Source/render/layout.c ****  * Measurement goes through g_measure (default: pd getTextWidth with the
  19:Source/render/layout.c ****  * given font; NULL font → body font; empty → 0), swappable for the battery.
  20:Source/render/layout.c ****  *
  21:Source/render/layout.c ****  * String lifetime: items BORROW strings from the parsed document; FlowWord
  22:Source/render/layout.c ****  * text storage (word buffers) is arena-owned by g_wordArena and freed by
